    "$S=\\sqrt{21\\cdot8\\cdot7\\cdot6}=\\sqrt{7056}=84$.",
    "$S=\\dfrac12\\cdot AC\\cdot h$, откуда $h=\\dfrac{2\\cdot84}{15}=11{,}2$."
   ],
